WT walker L191–211 (I11 `depth`):

```
depth = 1   # after optional skip of sink LPAREN
LPAREN → depth++
RPAREN → depth--; stop iff depth <= 0
IDENT  → c_secret_refuse_sink_resolved(env, sid, nm)
```

`eprintln(id(1), tok)`: `id` LPAREN → 2; `)` → 1; IDENT `tok` → refuse.
`println(f(g(), tok))`: `f(` → 2; `g(` → 3; `)` → 2; `,`; `tok` → refuse.

